      "tags": ["log-analysis", "stats", "ui-panel"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:web/js/cmd-lib.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "cmd-lib.js",
      "filePath": "web/js/cmd-lib.js",
      "summary": "命令库面板：常用命令持久化在后端（cmdlib.json，跨端口/重启保留），支持添加（备注名+命令、去重）、编辑模态框、删除、发送与拖拽排序（拖动中不动 DOM 只标落点，drop 时一次性重排数组）；另渲染最近命令历史供一键重发。",
      "tags": ["ui-panel", "persistence", "drag-drop", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "拖拽排序的关键教训：dragover 里实时移动 DOM 会造成移动-触发-再移动循环（UI 抖动），正确做法是拖动过程只高亮落点方向、drop 时按条目中线判断前/后一次性 splice 重排。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/cmd-lib.js:renderCmdPane",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "renderCmdPane",
      "filePath": "web/js/cmd-lib.js",
      "lineRange": [20, 137],
      "summary": "渲染命令库（含编辑/发送/删除按钮与拖拽排序全套事件绑定）与最近命令列表（调 /api/history 取当前连接历史，取最近 15 条供重发）。",
      "tags": ["ui-panel", "rendering", "drag-drop", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/cmd-lib.js:sendCmd",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "sendCmd",
      "filePath": "web/js/cmd-lib.js",
      "lineRange": [169, 173],
      "summary": "把命令 POST 到 /api/send 发送到当前活动连接，无活动连接时提示错误。",
      "tags": ["api-client", "command-sending", "utility"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:web/js/data-dir.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "data-dir.js",
      "filePath": "web/js/data-dir.js",
      "summary": "数据目录管理：顶栏 logo 即入口，面板展示当前目录/子目录统计；改目录走「输入即校验（check API 预览+告警）→ 确认弹窗 → 覆盖式进度面板 → 迁移（先复制后切换，失败不切换）」；首启引导用独立标记 data_dir_prompted 与是否迁移解耦（防每次启动重弹）。",
      "tags": ["ui-panel", "data-migration", "validation", "modal", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "确认弹窗每次调用必须重绑 onclick——复用首次创建时绑定的旧 resolve（其 Promise 已 settled）会让新 Promise 永远 pending，表现为「点确定无反应」；_ddConfirm 用每次重绑 resolve 的写法规避。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/data-dir.js:_ddModal",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_ddModal",
      "filePath": "web/js/data-dir.js",
      "lineRange": [15, 121],
      "summary": "构建（单例）数据目录设置弹窗：展示当前目录与统计、新路径输入（400ms 防抖调 /api/data_dir/check 校验并预览迁移项）、迁移按钮（确认→进度面板→/api/data_dir/migrate）、打开目录与原生目录选择。",
      "tags": ["modal", "validation", "data-migration"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/data-dir.js:_ddProgress",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_ddProgress",
      "filePath": "web/js/data-dir.js",
      "lineRange": [144, 182],
      "summary": "迁移进度面板：环形动画 + 按 4s 节奏推进的阶段文案（复制→校验→切换），迁移跑在同步请求里无法真流式报进度，请求返回即 hide() 终止。",
      "tags": ["ui-panel", "progress", "data-migration"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:web/js/data-dir.js:_ddConfirm",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_ddConfirm",
      "filePath": "web/js/data-dir.js",
      "lineRange": [188, 214],
      "summary": "应用风格确认弹窗（返回 Promise<boolean>）：DOM 单例但每次调用都重绑按钮 onclick 并消费本次的 resolve，规避旧闭包 resolve 导致的「点确定无反应」坑。",
      "tags": ["modal", "confirmation", "async"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
