      "lineRange": [18, 66],
      "summary": "增量扫描 xterm buffer 自上次以来的新行，对每条关键字正则命中创建 registerDecoration 前景色高亮；注意 registerMarker 参数是相对偏移（r - ybase - y）而非绝对行号，最后裁剪 decoration 总量到 3000 上限。",
      "tags": ["xterm", "highlighting", "performance"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:web/js/history.js",
